<title>ITALY: Italian total bank lending grew 2.5 pct in Dec.</title>
<headline>Italian total bank lending grew 2.5 pct in Dec.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian total bank lending grew 2.5 percent year-on-year in December, the Bank of Italy said in a statement. It issued the following provisional year-on-year percentage changes:</p>
<p>			  Dec 1996    Nov 1996	 Dec 1995</p>
<p>Total bank lending  +2.5 pct	+2.1 pct	+2.7 pct</p>
<p>Lira bank lending   +3.4 pct	+3.3 pct	+6.7 pct</p>
<p>Deposits		+2.3 pct	+2.9 pct	+1.7 pct</p>
<p>Note: Previous month's figures may have been revised from puclication last month.</p>
</text>
